# Shadows of the Departed (jeuno 88): the Timer edge (VanadielUniqueDay() >= Timer; the harness's Vana'diel clock starts
# at hour 12 of day 8000). A level 75 Warrior, Storms of Fate completed, Zilart Awakening current, brought to status 3
# (Norg, then _6tc). Timer 8001 (a GM): area 1: no section; Timer 8000: 161 (its finish begins on any option). Then a GM
# sets the quest available and the Timer 8001 again; `wait vana=12` (day 8001): area 1: 161. The main flow's Timer 0
# is the side under the day.
lists RuludeGardens/onTriggerAreaEnter/1 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/161
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=4,2.5,100 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.StormsOfFate completed
mission Zilart Awakening current
charvar Quest[3][88]Timer 8001
login
warp 120.9,-8,-12 Norg                  # 176: status 1
warp 39.6,-1.6,-16.6 LowerJeuno         # by _6tc
trigger _6tc                            # 20
finish                                  # status 3
warp 4,2.5,100 RuludeGardens
tick 3000                               # the zone-in lock (2.5 s) keeps trigger areas off
walk 4,2.5,60                           # Timer 8001 > day 8000: no section; nothing
walk 4,2.5,100
charvar Quest[3][88]Timer 8000          # a GM: today
walk 4,2.5,60                           # Timer 8000 = day 8000: 161
finish option=7                         # begun (any option)
walk 4,2.5,100
quest Jeuno.ShadowsOfTheDeparted available  # a GM
charvar Quest[3][88]Timer 8001          # a GM
wait vana=12                            # day 8001
walk 4,2.5,60                           # Timer 8001 = day 8001: 161
finish                                  # begun
